English summary (the Spanish text above prevails): yapa is free to use. Anyone may install it on their own server and
offer it to their clients as a hosted service, charging for that service, without asking permission or paying royalties,
as long as they use unmodified official builds, keep the yapa name and notices, and do not claim to be the author.
Selling or redistributing copies of the software is not permitted. It is closed-source: no modification, reverse
engineering or source redistribution. Provided "as is" without warranty.
